WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Stoicism has given me the gift of being

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:07.000
hard to get, but easy to please and easy

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.360
to receive. And that's the gift that

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:11.200
keeps giving, so I'm pretty spoiled

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:12.680
right now because being the observer is

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.720
much more powerful than being the

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:16.120
participant, which means you become the

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:17.360
player instead of being played. I

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:19.120
shouldn't even be telling you this right

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:21.440
now because I'm giving my game away, but

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:23.040
trust me, when you come into anything at

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:25.880
all with visible standards and

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:27.840
expectations, the world will rearrange

00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:29.880
itself around you and serve you. Your

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:31.760
whole life will become easy. And I say,

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:33.960
"Be a bit more difficult." Cuz the

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:35.880
opposite of that will be you're too

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:38.360
easy, so that you rearrange yourself

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:40.120
around everyone else. It is always the

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:42.960
people who have been through a lot of

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:45.480
pain in life who develop this tolerance

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:46.920
for the insanities of life. And that's

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:48.720
also how we know better, right?

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:50.400
Unfortunately for me, but I guess

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:52.440
fortunately for me at this point, I am

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:54.720
one of those people, and if you're one

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:57.280
of them, I truly see you, and I also

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:59.160
raise you. Stoicism, I studied Stoicism

00:00:57.280 --> 00:01:01.880
vigorously for the last 3 years, and it

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:03.600
started off as a coping strategy because

00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:05.560
I genuinely needed something to stop me

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:07.080
from crashing out, but it became my way

00:01:05.560 --> 00:01:09.880
of life because it rebuilt how I

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:12.920
processed my reality entirely. I used to

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:14.880
feel everything all the time, a little

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:16.760
bit too much, and every little slight

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:19.000
became a whole crisis for me. When

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:20.760
someone didn't agree with me, I saw it

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:23.360
as a betrayal, and now I can fully

00:01:20.760 --> 00:01:25.720
empathize and maintain my spirit without

00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:28.120
descending into madness. And that's what

00:01:25.720 --> 00:01:30.080
makes me so-called strong, I guess. This

00:01:28.120 --> 00:01:31.560
has taken me years to learn, and you

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:32.880
will learn how to do this by the end of

00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:34.320
this video, and I promise everything

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:36.360
will just flow to you. If you don't know

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:38.400
me yet, my name is May, and my community

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:40.080
is called Stoic Angels. We're all here

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:42.480
actively leveling up physically,

00:01:40.080 --> 00:01:44.800
mentally, and spiritually. Today, I'm

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:47.440
giving you some of the Stoic standards I

00:01:44.800 --> 00:01:49.200
set for myself that completely changed

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:50.960
the way people treat me and how I treat

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:53.880
myself. Because your own personal

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:55.720
philosophy does show up in your face,

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:57.120
your body, your energy, your aura, and

00:01:55.720 --> 00:01:58.960
everything. [music] Some of you guys are

