more difficult. I don't mean become an

00:02:11.360 --> 00:02:14.760
icy cold rude person because even

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:17.360
energetically speaking, if you're

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:19.520
so-called energetically expensive,

00:02:17.360 --> 00:02:21.320
