00:02:19.520 --> 00:02:22.920
wasting your time and they're going to

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:24.800
show up as their best selves because

00:02:22.920 --> 00:02:26.800
they know you don't mess around and

00:02:24.800 --> 00:02:29.000
you're definitely not available for any

00:02:26.800 --> 00:02:30.400
kind of nonsense or shenanigans. This

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:32.640
