00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:28.560
probably thinking, "Girl, just say

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:30.680
you're not coming." When you over

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:31.959
explain so much and give everyone your

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:34.040
sob story, it's like you're constantly

00:03:31.959 --> 00:03:35.959
apologizing for yourself. And what I was

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:38.160
really saying was, "Please don't think

00:03:35.959 --> 00:03:40.680
badly of me for choosing myself." Which

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:42.440
is insane because we have to realize not

00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:44.000
everyone is judging us all the time. Why

00:03:42.440 --> 00:03:46.040
are we constantly anticipating that

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:48.320
sense of judgement? Maybe it's because

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:50.160
we are secretly judging everyone. My

00:03:48.320 --> 00:03:52.360
standard that I set for myself is I I

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:54.480
the choice and I sit with it. If someone

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:56.000
