00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:10.000
me. I would have a bad day, which is

00:07:08.160 --> 00:07:12.680
normal, everyone does, but instead of

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:15.280
just having a bad day, I would also need

00:07:12.680 --> 00:07:16.480
