00:07:23.320 --> 00:07:27.240
said, "Oh my gosh, like that's so

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:29.560
unfair. That really sucks." Like, no, I

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:32.040
actually [music] needed someone else to

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:34.040
also feel my pain, which is super

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:36.360
exhausting ultimately, not just for the

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:39.040
people around you, but also [music] for

00:07:36.360 --> 00:07:40.800
yourself. This is why venting is no

00:07:39.040 --> 00:07:43.320
good. You're training yourself to

00:07:40.800 --> 00:07:45.800
